{
    "id":  11065,
    "lang":  "en",
    "name":  "RF Wall Touch Control Panel - LED RGB + CCT - 4 Zones",
    "reference":  "92063-B4",
    "short_description":  "\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRF Touch Surface Control Panel\u003c/strong\u003e, this elegant remote control is designed to adjust the color temperature and intensity of our \u003cstrong\u003eRGB - CCT LED strips\u003c/strong\u003e, providing customized lighting. \u003cstrong\u003eCapable of managing up to 4 programmable zones,\u003c/strong\u003e it operates with up to 9 dynamic modes and precise control from a distance of up to 30 meters. Additionally, its easy magnetic installation guarantees a quick, hassle-free setup. Compatible with our controller \u003cstrong\u003eREF: 92061-ER-RF.\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e",
    "description":  "\u003ch2\u003eRF Wall Touch Control Panel - LED RGB + CCT - 4 Zones\u003c/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eRF Surface Touch Control Panel\u003c/strong\u003e is a sophisticated modern device for comprehensive RGB-CCT LED strip control. Adjusts color temperature and intensity, provides totally personalized lighting for residential or commercial.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eKey Features\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColor Temperature and Brightness Adjustment:\u003c/strong\u003e Wide range of options for personalized ambient.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eProgrammable Zone Management:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 4 programmable zones independently controlled.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eDynamic Modes:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 9 different dynamic modes.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrecise Remote Control:\u003c/strong\u003e 2.4G RF wireless transmission, up to 30 meters.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eMagnetic Installation:\u003c/strong\u003e Quick wireless mounting.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eAdvanced Technology:\u003c/strong\u003e High-precision capacitive touch IC.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e Compatible with MiBoxer/Mi-Light 2.4G series.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCustomizable Colors:\u003c/strong\u003e 16 million colors with brightness, color temperature, saturation adjustment.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003ch4\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnical Specs\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/h4\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTechnology:\u003c/strong\u003e 2.4G RF wireless\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eControl Distance:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 30m\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eColors:\u003c/strong\u003e 16 million\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eModes:\u003c/strong\u003e 9 dynamic\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eZones:\u003c/strong\u003e Up to 4 programmable\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eInstallation:\u003c/strong\u003e Magnetic, no wiring\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCompatibility:\u003c/strong\u003e MiBoxer/Mi-Light 2.4G series\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eVersatile tool for residential and commercial applications.\u003c/p\u003e",
